nd eyes made out of coal... There must have been some magic in that old silk hat they found... He began to dance around. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Ah Frosty, the snowman knew the sun was hot that day, so he said, \"Let's run and we'll have some fun now, before I melt away.\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Down to the village with a broomstick in his hand, runnin' here and there, all around the square, sayin', \"Catch me if you can!\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Frosty, the snowman, he had to hurry on his way, but he waved goodbye sayin', \"Don't you cry, I'll be back again some day.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's go build a snowman."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens620","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"-200,0"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M620","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":19,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma does not answer. She just keeps staring thoughtfully in the direction that the song is coming from."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is something wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":19,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You two go on ahead. I have something else to do."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"s